{"id":"16-verify","number":16,"slug":"verification-and-guardrails","title":"Verify and guard","short":"Verify and guard","module":"Composing judgments","summary":"Decision models are cheap and fast enough to check everything: every citation an LLM writes, every message going in and out, every extracted field. Here is a citation check, a one-request guardrail screen, why two independent checks beat one, and why none of this is a security boundary.","voice":"Jessica","scenes":[{"template":"title","chapter":"Intro","narration":"Language models write. Decision models can check what they wrote, fast and cheap enough to check every single output. This lesson is about judges and guards.","params":{"kicker":"Lesson 16","module":"Module 4 · Composing judgments","title":"Verify and *guard*","subtitle":"Fast judges for everything an LLM writes, reads, or does.","cast":["snap",{"who":"mull","mood":"think"}]},"start":0.5,"dur":11.806,"words":[{"text":"Language","s":0.8,"e":1.28},{"text":"models","s":1.36,"e":1.68},{"text":"write.","s":1.84,"e":2.48},{"text":"Decision","s":2.72,"e":3.12},{"text":"models","s":3.2,"e":3.52},{"text":"can","s":3.6,"e":3.76},{"text":"check","s":3.88,"e":4},{"text":"what","s":4.08,"e":4.16},{"text":"they","s":4.2,"e":4.24},{"text":"wrote,","s":4.32,"e":4.96},{"text":"fast","s":5.04,"e":5.44},{"text":"and","s":5.56,"e":5.68},{"text":"cheap","s":5.8,"e":5.92},{"text":"enough","s":6,"e":6.24},{"text":"to","s":6.32,"e":6.4},{"text":"check","s":6.56,"e":6.72},{"text":"every","s":6.8,"e":7.12},{"text":"single","s":7.28,"e":7.6},{"text":"output.","s":7.68,"e":8.64},{"text":"This","s":8.76,"e":8.88},{"text":"lesson","s":9.08,"e":9.28},{"text":"is","s":9.36,"e":9.44},{"text":"about","s":9.52,"e":9.68},{"text":"judges","s":9.84,"e":10.32},{"text":"and","s":10.4,"e":10.48},{"text":"guards.","s":10.56,"e":11.44}]},{"template":"request","chapter":"Check the citation","narration":"Say an LLM writes: walking seven thousand steps a day cuts hospitalization risk by thirty one percent, the study proved. And it cites a quote. One Choice checks the claim against the quote in the context of the source. The answer: partially, at point nine nine. The number is right, but the source is an observational study that proved nothing.","params":{"model":"jev-1.13.0","latency":0.24,"state":{"claim":"Walking 7,000 steps a day cuts hospitalization risk by 31%, the study proved.","quote":"Participants who walked at least 7,000 steps a day had a 31% lower risk of hospitalization…","source":"…The authors caution that the study was observational."},"questions":[{"id":"s","type":"choice","text":"Does `quote`, in the context of `source`, support `claim`? (supports / partially / contradicts / unrelated)","ans":{"choice":"partially","p":0.99},"at":"One Choice"}],"send_at":"One Choice","ans_at":"The answer","footer":"Real answer, jev-1.13.0. “partially” = backs part of the claim but overstates it."},"start":12.306,"dur":23.781,"words":[{"text":"Say","s":12.606,"e":12.926},{"text":"an","s":13.046,"e":13.166},{"text":"LLM","s":13.246,"e":13.886},{"text":"writes:","s":13.966,"e":14.686},{"text":"walking","s":14.926,"e":15.326},{"text":"seven","s":15.406,"e":15.646},{"text":"thousand","s":15.806,"e":16.046},{"text":"steps","s":16.126,"e":16.366},{"text":"a","s":16.446,"e":16.526},{"text":"day","s":16.606,"e":16.846},{"text":"cuts","s":17.006,"e":17.246},{"text":"hospitalization","s":17.486,"e":18.126},{"text":"risk","s":18.206,"e":18.526},{"text":"by","s":18.646,"e":18.766},{"text":"thirty","s":18.846,"e":19.086},{"text":"one","s":19.166,"e":19.246},{"text":"percent,","s":19.326,"e":20.046},{"text":"the","s":20.086,"e":20.126},{"text":"study","s":20.206,"e":20.446},{"text":"proved.","s":20.526,"e":21.246},{"text":"And","s":21.406,"e":21.566},{"text":"it","s":21.646,"e":21.726},{"text":"cites","s":21.766,"e":21.966},{"text":"a","s":22.006,"e":22.046},{"text":"quote.","s":22.126,"e":23.006},{"text":"One","s":23.086,"e":23.166},{"text":"Choice","s":23.246,"e":2