n the source **word for word**? Best check?","options":["A Noul: “Is the quote in the source verbatim?”","A Score for similarity","A string match in code","Ask the LLM to double-check itself"],"answer":2,"explain":"Exact text checks are code's job. Use the decision model for meaning: does the quote, in context, support the claim?"},"start":168.48,"dur":13.049,"words":[{"text":"Quick","s":168.78,"e":169.02},{"text":"check.","s":169.1,"e":169.62},{"text":"You","s":169.82,"e":169.98},{"text":"want","s":170.06,"e":170.14},{"text":"to","s":170.18,"e":170.22},{"text":"know","s":170.3,"e":170.46},{"text":"whether","s":170.54,"e":170.78},{"text":"an","s":170.9,"e":171.02},{"text":"LLM's","s":171.1,"e":171.66},{"text":"answer","s":171.9,"e":172.14},{"text":"quotes","s":172.22,"e":172.54},{"text":"the","s":172.62,"e":172.7},{"text":"source","s":172.78,"e":173.02},{"text":"document","s":173.1,"e":173.5},{"text":"exactly.","s":173.66,"e":174.94},{"text":"What's","s":175.02,"e":175.18},{"text":"the","s":175.22,"e":175.26},{"text":"best","s":175.42,"e":175.66},{"text":"check?","s":175.74,"e":176.38}]},{"template":"exercise","chapter":"Try it","narration":"Try it. Have your agent add one judge and one guard to your LLM feature.","params":{"title":"Add a judge and a guard","intro":"Paste this into your coding agent:","prompt":"For our main LLM feature, add:\n1. An input guard: one decision-model request with narrow hazard Nouls\n   (injection, PII, abuse, out of scope) + a severity Score, mapped in\n   code to pass / review / block / route (e.g. redact PII).\n2. An output judge: for each claim with a citation, check the quote\n   exists verbatim in code, then ask a Choice whether the quote, in\n   context, supports / partially supports / contradicts the claim.\nLog every verdict with its probabilities, and test on 30 examples."},"start":181.529,"dur":6.018,"words":[{"text":"Try","s":181.829,"e":182.069},{"text":"it.","s":182.149,"e":182.389},{"text":"Have","s":182.709,"e":182.869},